msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Pozadí {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A QCSC workflow runs a QPU and an HPC system as one machine.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) runs QCSC workflows on\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) and keeps them traceable, configurable, and resumable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pracovní postup QCSC provozuje QPU a systém HPC jako jeden stroj.\n"
"[QCSC-Prefect](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qcsc-prefect) spouští pracovní postupy QCSC na\n"
"[Prefect](https://www.prefect.io/) a udržuje je dohledatelné, konfigurovatelné a obnovitelné.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates these features with sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) of the N$_2$ molecule. The [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) samples the circuit inside a [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/) job. The\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) eigensolver diagonalizes the sampled\n"
"subspaces in more Slurm jobs. One [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud) deployment runs both.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tento tutoriál tyto funkce předvádí na vzorkové kvantové diagonalizaci (SQD) molekuly N$_2$. [Quantum Resource Management Interface (QRMI)](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) vzorkuje obvod uvnitř úlohy [Slurm](https://slurm.schedmd.com/). Řešič vlastních hodnot\n"
"[Fulqrum](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fulqrum) diagonalizuje vzorkované\n"
"podprostory v dalších úlohách Slurm. Obojí spouští jedno nasazení [Prefect Cloud](https://www.prefect.io/cloud).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect also runs large QCSC workloads, as in the following projects.\n"
msgstr "QCSC-Prefect také spouští velké úlohy QCSC, jako v následujících projektech.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of protein-ligand complexes with more than 12,000 atoms used QCSC-Prefect. It\n"
"sampled quantum-embedding fragments on two 156-qubit IBM Quantum processors, with up to 94\n"
"qubits, and diagonalized the fragment subspaces on the Fugaku, Miyabi-G, and ROQUO\n"
"supercomputers [\\[1\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Studie komplexů protein-ligand s více než 12 000 atomy používala QCSC-Prefect. Vzorkovala\n"
"fragmenty kvantového vnoření na dvou 156qubitových procesorech IBM Quantum, s až 94\n"
"qubity, a diagonalizovala podprostory fragmentů na superpočítačích Fugaku, Miyabi-G a ROQUO\n"
"[\\[1\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A study of iron-sulfur clusters ran an extended QCSC-Prefect SQD workflow with 36 orbitals\n"
"(72 qubits) and subspace dimensions up to $3 \\times 10^{10}$ on the Fugaku, Miyabi, and\n"
"ROQUO supercomputers [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr ""
"Studie klastrů železo-síra spustila rozšířený pracovní postup QCSC-Prefect SQD s 36 orbitaly\n"
"(72 qubitů) a dimenzemi podprostorů až $3 \\times 10^{10}$ na superpočítačích Fugaku, Miyabi a\n"
"ROQUO [\\[2\\]](#references).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "The challenge of QCSC workflows {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"
msgstr "Výzva pracovních postupů QCSC {#the-challenge-of-qcsc-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SQD workflow is typical of QCSC workloads. QCSC-Prefect answers each of its challenges\n"
"with one feature, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pracovní postup SQD je pro úlohy QCSC typický. QCSC-Prefect odpovídá na každou z jeho výzev\n"
"jednou funkcí, jak ukazuje následující tabulka.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Challenge | QCSC-Prefect feature |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| It spans several resources. A Slurm job holds the QPU, then many Slurm jobs diagonalize subspaces, round after round. | Traceable workflow |\n"
"| It has many parameters at different levels (science, circuit, and cluster), and credentials must stay out of all of them. | Configurable parameters |\n"
"| It is long and can fail anywhere, from a walltime limit, a node failure, or a long QPU queue. Without care, a late failure means sampling on the QPU again. | Resumable execution |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Výzva | Funkce QCSC-Prefect |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Zahrnuje několik prostředků. Úloha Slurm drží QPU, poté mnoho úloh Slurm diagonalizuje podprostory, kolo za kolem. | Dohledatelný pracovní postup |\n"
"| Má mnoho parametrů na různých úrovních (věda, obvod a cluster) a přihlašovací údaje musí zůstat mimo všechny z nich. | Konfigurovatelné parametry |\n"
"| Je dlouhý a může selhat kdekoli, kvůli limitu walltime, selhání uzlu nebo dlouhé frontě QPU. Bez opatření znamená pozdní selhání opětovné vzorkování na QPU. | Obnovitelné spouštění |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each step of [Qiskit Pattern in QCSC-Prefect step by step](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) ends with a box that shows how QCSC-Prefect traces, configures, and resumes that stage.\n"
msgstr "Každý krok [Qiskit patternu v QCSC-Prefect krok za krokem](#qiskit-pattern-in-qcsc-prefect-step-by-step) končí rámečkem, který ukazuje, jak QCSC-Prefect danou fázi sleduje, konfiguruje a obnovuje.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Traceable workflow {#traceable-workflow}"
msgstr "Dohledatelný pracovní postup {#traceable-workflow}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A Prefect *flow* is a Python function made of *tasks*. QCSC-Prefect makes each stage of a\n"
"[Qiskit pattern](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute**, and **Postprocess**) one task. For every run, Prefect Cloud shows the following information:\n"
msgstr ""
"*Flow* Prefectu je funkce Pythonu složená z *úloh* (tasks). QCSC-Prefect dělá z každé fáze\n"
"[Qiskit patternu](/guides/intro-to-patterns) (**Map**, **Optimize**, **Execute** a **Postprocess**) jednu úlohu. Pro každý běh Prefect Cloud zobrazuje následující informace:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The task graph, with an arrow wherever one task passes its result to another.\n"
msgstr "Graf úloh se šipkou všude tam, kde jedna úloha předává svůj výsledek jiné.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The state, inputs, logs, and duration of each task, filterable by the stage tags `map`, `optimize`, `execute`, and `post-process`.\n"
msgstr "Stav, vstupy, protokoly a dobu trvání každé úlohy, filtrovatelné podle štítků fází `map`, `optimize`, `execute` a `post-process`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The *artifacts*, which are tables and links that tasks publish, such as the source of the\n"
"samples or the energy of each subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"*Artefakty*, což jsou tabulky a odkazy, které úlohy publikují, například zdroj\n"
"vzorků nebo energie každého podprostoru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The workflow host only submits and monitors work. The compute-intensive work runs as Slurm jobs, as in the following image.\n"
msgstr "Hostitel pracovního postupu pouze odesílá a monitoruje práci. Výpočetně náročná práce běží jako úlohy Slurm, jak ukazuje následující obrázek.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Prefect Cloud holds the runs, logs, and artifacts. The workflow host polls Prefect Cloud for runs and reports states and logs. The served deployment on the workflow host submits and monitors the Slurm jobs. The workflow host submits a Slurm job (`sbatch --qpu`) that runs the QRMI worker, which transpiles the circuit and samples it on the IBM Quantum QPU. It also submits one Fulqrum Slurm job (`sbatch`) per subspace.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/where-work-runs.svg 'What runs where')\n"
msgstr "![Prefect Cloud holds the runs, logs, and artifacts. The workflow host polls Prefect Cloud for runs and reports states and logs. The served deployment on the workflow host submits and monitors the Slurm jobs. The workflow host submits a Slurm job (`sbatch --qpu`) that runs the QRMI worker, which transpiles the circuit and samples it on the IBM Quantum QPU. It also submits one Fulqrum Slurm job (`sbatch`) per subspace.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/where-work-runs.svg 'What runs where')\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configurable parameters {#configurable-parameters}"
msgstr "Konfigurovatelné parametry {#configurable-parameters}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "QCSC-Prefect keeps each kind of setting in its own place, as in the following table.\n"
msgstr "QCSC-Prefect udržuje každý druh nastavení na vlastním místě, jak ukazuje následující tabulka.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Kind | Examples | Changes | Where it lives |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Run parameters | Molecule, shots, subspace dimension | Every run | The Prefect Cloud run form, grouped by stage |\n"
"| Blocks | Partition, walltime, threads, executable paths, QPU resource | Per cluster | Prefect blocks, created one time |\n"
"| Credentials | Prefect API key, IBM Quantum API key | Rarely | The Prefect Cloud login on the workflow host, and QRMI (`qcsc-qrmi login`) on the cluster, both set up in the setup guide |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Druh | Příklady | Mění se | Kde žije |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Parametry běhu | Molekula, počet shotů, dimenze podprostoru | Každý běh | Formulář běhu Prefect Cloud, seskupený podle fáze |\n"
"| Bloky | Partition, walltime, vlákna, cesty ke spustitelným souborům, prostředek QPU | Na cluster | Bloky Prefect, vytvořené jednou |\n"
"| Přihlašovací údaje | Klíč API Prefect, klíč API IBM Quantum | Zřídka | Přihlášení do Prefect Cloud na hostiteli pracovního postupu a QRMI (`qcsc-qrmi login`) na clusteru, obojí nastavené v průvodci nastavením |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The blocks describe each job in the three layers of the following table.\n"
msgstr "Bloky popisují každou úlohu ve třech vrstvách následující tabulky.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Block | Specifies | Contents |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `CommandBlock` | What runs | The executable and its default arguments |\n"
"| `ExecutionProfileBlock` | How it runs | Nodes, threads, walltime, launcher, modules, and environment |\n"
"| `HPCProfileBlock` | Where it runs | Scheduler, partition, account, and the path of each executable on that system |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Blok | Určuje | Obsah |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `CommandBlock` | Co běží | Spustitelný soubor a jeho výchozí argumenty |\n"
"| `ExecutionProfileBlock` | Jak běží | Uzly, vlákna, walltime, launcher, moduly a prostředí |\n"
"| `HPCProfileBlock` | Kde běží | Plánovač, partition, účet a cesta ke každému spustitelnému souboru v daném systému |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The flow loads blocks by name when it runs, so a change to a block leaves the flow and its run\n"
"parameters unchanged.\n"
msgstr ""
"Flow načítá bloky podle názvu při běhu, takže změna bloku nechává flow a jeho parametry\n"
"běhu beze změny.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resumable execution {#resumable-execution}"
msgstr "Obnovitelné spouštění {#resumable-execution}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Prefect stores the results of the first three stages with the flow run. If a later task\n"
"fails, **Retry** on the flow run reuses the stored results and runs only what failed, as in\n"
"the following image.\n"
msgstr ""
"Prefect ukládá výsledky prvních tří fází spolu s během flow. Pokud pozdější úloha\n"
"selže, **Retry** na běhu flow znovu použije uložené výsledky a spustí jen to, co selhalo, jak ukazuje\n"
"následující obrázek.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![When a run fails and you raise the walltime in the block, Retry repeats only the last stage and reuses the results of the first three stages.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/retry-failed-run.svg 'Retry a failed run')\n"
msgstr "![When a run fails and you raise the walltime in the block, Retry repeats only the last stage and reuses the results of the first three stages.](/docs/images/tutorials/qcsc-prefect/retry-failed-run.svg 'Retry a failed run')\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A new run can also load the samples of an earlier run instead of sampling, because the Execute\n"
"stage records where its samples are.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nový běh může také načíst vzorky dřívějšího běhu místo vzorkování, protože fáze Execute\n"
"zaznamenává, kde jsou její vzorky.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "SQD at a glance {#sqd-at-a-glance}"
msgstr "SQD ve zkratce {#sqd-at-a-glance}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SQD samples bitstrings from a local unitary cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) circuit built from coupled cluster singles and doubles (CCSD) amplitudes, fixes the\n"
"bitstrings that noise has corrupted (*configuration recovery*), and diagonalizes the\n"
"Hamiltonian in subspaces spanned by the sampled configurations [\\[3\\]](#references). The\n"
"[SQD tutorial](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) explains the algorithm. In QCSC-Prefect, SQD is the\n"
"flow `sqd`, which has the following task graph.\n"
msgstr ""
"SQD vzorkuje bitové řetězce z obvodu lokálního unitárního klastru Jastrow (LUCJ) sestaveného z amplitud coupled cluster singles and doubles (CCSD), opravuje\n"
"bitové řetězce poškozené šumem (*obnova konfigurací*) a diagonalizuje\n"
"Hamiltonián v podprostorech vymezených vzorkovanými konfiguracemi [\\[3\\]](#references).\n"
"[Tutoriál SQD](/tutorials/sample-based-quantum-diagonalization) vysvětluje algoritmus. V QCSC-Prefect je SQD\n"
"flow `sqd`, které má následující graf úloh.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Stage | Task | Input from another task |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| Map | `compute_molecular_integrals` | None |\n"
"| Optimize | `get_lucj_params` | Integrals from Map |\n"
"| Execute | `quantum_sampling`, with `build_lucj_circuit` inside it | LUCJ parameters from Optimize |\n"
"| Postprocess | `sqd_loop` | Integrals from Map, and samples from Execute |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Fáze | Úloha | Vstup z jiné úlohy |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| Map | `compute_molecular_integrals` | Žádný |\n"
"| Optimize | `get_lucj_params` | Integrály z Map |\n"
"| Execute | `quantum_sampling`, s `build_lucj_circuit` uvnitř | Parametry LUCJ z Optimize |\n"
"| Postprocess | `sqd_loop` | Integrály z Map a vzorky z Execute |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When a run reuses samples, `load_qrmi_result` (or `load_runtime_job` for samples from IBM\n"
"Quantum Platform) replaces both `get_lucj_params` and `quantum_sampling`, so the run has no\n"
"Optimize task. In random mode (**Quantum Source** set to `random`), there is no Optimize or\n"
"Execute task, and Map feeds `sqd_loop` directly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Když běh znovu používá vzorky, `load_qrmi_result` (nebo `load_runtime_job` pro vzorky z IBM\n"
"Quantum Platform) nahradí `get_lucj_params` i `quantum_sampling`, takže běh nemá žádnou\n"
"úlohu Optimize. V náhodném režimu (**Quantum Source** nastaveno na `random`) není žádná úloha Optimize ani\n"
"Execute a Map posílá data přímo do `sqd_loop`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The example is N$_2$ at a bond length of 1.1 $\\AA$ in the 6-31G basis, with the two 1s core\n"
"orbitals frozen. This leaves 16 spatial orbitals with five $\\alpha$ and five $\\beta$ electrons,\n"
"which is a 32-qubit circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Příkladem je N$_2$ při délce vazby 1,1 $\\AA$ v bázi 6-31G, se dvěma zmrazenými jádrovými orbitaly 1s.\n"
"To ponechá 16 prostorových orbitalů s pěti elektrony $\\alpha$ a pěti $\\beta$,\n"
"co je 32qubitový obvod.\n"

