#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit the settings at the top of `sqd_blocks.toml` as in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Uprav nastavení na začátku souboru `sqd_blocks.toml` podle následující tabulky.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Parameter | Example | Description |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `python_executable` | `\"~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python\"` | The Python of `~/venv/qcsc-node`, with the hook from [Install the Fulqrum solver on a compute node](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `profile` | `\"slurm\"` | System profile, which is `slurm`, `slurm-gpu`, `miyabi`, `miyabi-gpu`, `fugaku`, or a path to your own file |\n"
"| `solver` | `\"fulqrum\"` | Subspace diagonalizer, which is `fulqrum`, `sbd`, or `dice` |\n"
"| `queue` | `\"normal\"` | Slurm partition of the solver jobs |\n"
"| `project` | `\"my-account\"` | Optional Slurm account (`#SBATCH --account`) |\n"
"| `work_dir` | `\"/shared/work/qcsc-prefect\"` | The value of `QCSC_WORK_DIR`, which holds the job directories |\n"
"| `fulqrum_executable` | `\"~/qcsc-prefect/packages/qcsc-prefect-fulqrum/native/fulqrum/bin/qcsc-fulqrum-solve\"` | The path that you recorded in [Install the Fulqrum solver on a compute node](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `eigensolver` | `\"primme\"` | The Fulqrum sparse solver, `primme` or `scipy`. The example file sets `scipy`. Set `primme` after a `FULQRUM_WITH_PRIMME=1` build |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Parametr | Příklad | Popis |\n"
"|---|---|---|\n"
"| `python_executable` | `\"~/venv/qcsc-node/bin/python\"` | Python z `~/venv/qcsc-node` s hákem z [Install the Fulqrum solver on a compute node](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `profile` | `\"slurm\"` | Profil systému: `slurm`, `slurm-gpu`, `miyabi`, `miyabi-gpu`, `fugaku`, nebo cesta k tvému vlastnímu souboru |\n"
"| `solver` | `\"fulqrum\"` | Diagonalizátor podprostoru: `fulqrum`, `sbd` nebo `dice` |\n"
"| `queue` | `\"normal\"` | Oddíl Slurm pro úlohy řešiče |\n"
"| `project` | `\"my-account\"` | Volitelný účet Slurm (`#SBATCH --account`) |\n"
"| `work_dir` | `\"/shared/work/qcsc-prefect\"` | Hodnota `QCSC_WORK_DIR`, která obsahuje adresáře úloh |\n"
"| `fulqrum_executable` | `\"~/qcsc-prefect/packages/qcsc-prefect-fulqrum/native/fulqrum/bin/qcsc-fulqrum-solve\"` | Cesta, kterou sis poznamenal(a) v [Install the Fulqrum solver on a compute node](#install-the-fulqrum-solver-on-a-compute-node) |\n"
"| `eigensolver` | `\"primme\"` | Řídký řešič Fulqrum, `primme` nebo `scipy`. Ukázkový soubor nastavuje `scipy`. Po sestavení s `FULQRUM_WITH_PRIMME=1` nastav `primme` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keep the following points in mind when you edit the file.\n"
msgstr "Při úpravě souboru měj na paměti následující body.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Write the paths out, because the file does not expand environment variables. The `~`\n"
"character works. Keep every top-level key, such as `python_executable`, before the first\n"
"table header.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cesty piš celé, protože soubor nerozšiřuje proměnné prostředí. Znak `~`\n"
"funguje. Každý klíč nejvyšší úrovně, například `python_executable`, uveď před první\n"
"hlavičkou tabulky.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `[qrmi]` table needs no change, because the `qrmi-runtime` block supplies the instance\n"
"and the QPU. Set `resource` only to override the backend. The credentials stay in\n"
"`qrmi_config.json`, not in this file.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tabulka `[qrmi]` nepotřebuje změnu, protože blok `qrmi-runtime` dodá instanci\n"
"a QPU. Nastav `resource` jen tehdy, když chceš přepsat backend. Přihlašovací údaje zůstávají\n"
"v `qrmi_config.json`, ne v tomto souboru.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `slurm` profile holds the scheduler and resource settings of a generic Slurm cluster, and\n"
"any key in your file overrides it. The commented `[sqd_advanced]` table sets the\n"
"`sqd-advanced-settings` block, the commented `[advanced]` table sets block names and timeouts,\n"
"and the table of each solver holds its tuning. To choose the nodes, ranks, and threads of the solver jobs, see\n"
"[Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/).\n"
msgstr ""
"Profil `slurm` obsahuje nastavení plánovače a prostředků obecného clusteru Slurm a\n"
"každý klíč ve tvém souboru ho přepíše. Zakomentovaná tabulka `[sqd_advanced]` nastavuje\n"
"blok `sqd-advanced-settings`, zakomentovaná tabulka `[advanced]` nastavuje názvy bloků a časové limity\n"
"a tabulka každého řešiče obsahuje jeho ladění. Informace o výběru uzlů, ranků a vláken pro úlohy řešiče najdeš v\n"
"[Size the SQD diagonalization for your HPC resources](https://qiskit-community.github.io/qcsc-prefect/tutorials/configure_sqd_solver_resources/).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The QRMI job and each solver job have a walltime of 12 hours (`#SBATCH --time`), and the flow waits up to 13\n"
"hours (`timeout_seconds = 46800`) for each job. To change the walltime, set `walltime` at\n"
"the top of the file for the solver jobs, or in the `[qrmi]` table for the QRMI job, for\n"
"example `walltime = \"02:00:00\"`. A shorter walltime can start sooner on a busy cluster.\n"
msgstr ""
"Úloha QRMI i každá úloha řešiče mají walltime 12 hodin (`#SBATCH --time`) a flow čeká na každou úlohu až 13\n"
"hodin (`timeout_seconds = 46800`). Chceš-li walltime změnit, nastav `walltime` na\n"
"začátku souboru pro úlohy řešiče nebo v tabulce `[qrmi]` pro úlohu QRMI, například\n"
"`walltime = \"02:00:00\"`. Kratší walltime může na vytíženém clusteru začít dříve.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the blocks.\n"
msgstr "Vytvoř bloky.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The command saves the blocks in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Příkaz uloží bloky z následující tabulky.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Block | Role |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Solver set (`cmd-sqd-fulqrum-solver`, `exec-sqd-fulqrum-slurm`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-fulqrum`) | The three layers of the solver jobs |\n"
"| QRMI set (`cmd-sqd-qrmi`, `exec-sqd-qrmi`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-qrmi`) | The three layers of the QRMI sampler job, which requests the QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | A `QrmiRuntimeBlock` (`scheduler = \"slurm\"`) with the Slurm settings of the QRMI set and the instance and backend from `qcsc-qrmi login`. It is the default **QRMI Runtime Block** of the run form |\n"
"| `sqd-fulqrum-solver` | A `FulqrumSolverJob` that wraps the solver set and holds the eigensolver settings |\n"
"| `sqd-advanced-settings` | The **Solver Block** of every run (`fulqrum_solver_job/sqd-fulqrum-solver`), the number of CCSD iterations (**CCSD Restarts**, 10 by default), reset mitigation, and the transpiler settings |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Blok | Role |\n"
"|---|---|\n"
"| Sada řešiče (`cmd-sqd-fulqrum-solver`, `exec-sqd-fulqrum-slurm`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-fulqrum`) | Tři vrstvy úloh řešiče |\n"
"| Sada QRMI (`cmd-sqd-qrmi`, `exec-sqd-qrmi`, `hpc-slurm-sqd-qrmi`) | Tři vrstvy úlohy QRMI sampleru, která si vyžádá QPU |\n"
"| `qrmi-runtime` | `QrmiRuntimeBlock` (`scheduler = \"slurm\"`) s nastavením Slurm pro sadu QRMI a s instancí a backendem z `qcsc-qrmi login`. Je to výchozí **QRMI Runtime Block** ve formuláři spuštění |\n"
"| `sqd-fulqrum-solver` | `FulqrumSolverJob`, který obaluje sadu řešiče a obsahuje nastavení řešiče vlastních čísel |\n"
"| `sqd-advanced-settings` | **Solver Block** každého spuštění (`fulqrum_solver_job/sqd-fulqrum-solver`), počet iterací CCSD (**CCSD Restarts**, výchozí 10), zmírnění resetu a nastavení transpileru |\n"

