msgid ""
"`sqd-deploy` serves the flow from the workflow host and picks up the runs that you start in\n"
"Prefect Cloud, so keep the terminal open while you run the workflow. The following command\n"
"also writes the output to a new log file under `$QCSC_WORK_DIR/logs/deploy` at each start,\n"
